FindProof -- equational theorem prover (CASC UEQ entry)

BUILD
  make                 # produces bin/FindProof  (needs a C11 compiler + libm)
  ./starexec_build     # equivalent, for StarExec

RUN (competition)
  bin/starexec_run_default PROBLEM.p
      Reads the wall-clock limit from $STAREXEC_WALLCLOCK_LIMIT (default 120s),
      runs a time-sliced portfolio, and writes SZS output to stdout.

RUN (manual)
  bin/FindProof --schedule --szs --proof --wall=120 PROBLEM.p
  bin/FindProof --szs PROBLEM.p                      # single default config
  bin/FindProof --list-knobs                         # the full strategy surface

INPUT   TPTP CNF unit-equality problems.  include('Axioms/*.ax') directives
        resolve against the problem directory and $TPTP.
OUTPUT  SZS ontology status (Unsatisfiable / Satisfiable / GaveUp / ResourceOut)
        and, with --proof, an SZS CNFRefutation block.

No external dependencies beyond the C standard library and libm.
